CST-DUST: kontinuierlicher Drei-Element-Sektor v0.1
X6 / Thomas Gfeller research working package, 2026-11-07.
Based on the Apache-2.0 repository thomasmgfeller/x6-spectral-astrolabium,
commit 9869528d008966a88052b65216da14eafce8db6f.
Eight source identities are pinned in inputs/provenance.json.
External literature is linked, not redistributed.
Continuous fields are integrated through n=3 in a conditional reference model.
Field phases for n>=4 are bounded by norm mass, not evaluated.
Coherent full-history access, the density prior and the boundary remain assumed.
No physical 4D dynamics, detector, bounce or exterior junction is selected.
All eight physical gates remain HOLD.
